id: weapon-ports
name: Weapon Ports
order: 2
optionOf: technological-being
optionEffect: 3
# Its two Installed Weapons, made as it is chosen.
installsWeapons: 2
description: >
  At Character Creation, create 2 Weapons with a Craftsmanship Grade of 2 that have different Weapon Types (and are not of the Shield Weapon Category). These Weapons possess the Artisan Weapon Quality (1 Slot). These Weapons are known as your ‘Installed Weapons’, are Integrated into your Character, and cannot be destroyed through any means.
text: >
  Weapon Ports [Passive, Ruling]: At Character Creation, create 2 Weapons with a Craftsmanship Grade of 2 that have different Weapon Types (and are not of the Shield Weapon Category). These Weapons possess the Artisan Weapon Quality (1 Slot). These Weapons are known as your ‘Installed Weapons’, are Integrated into your Character, and cannot be destroyed through any means.

---

# Chosen, the two Installed Weapons are made on the Gear tab (racial.mjs installWeapons): Grade 2, Artisan, of two different
# Weapon Types and no Shield, never damaged or destroyed (the user's). Integrated waits on Integrated Items.
